f hypnotic and analgesic based sedation in a general intensive care unit</article-title><source>Br J Anaesth</source><year>2007</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>76</fpage><lpage>82</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17158127</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bja/ael320</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>